{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 0,
    "dDurationMs": 4100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When your Social Security arrives by\ndirect deposit, it feels safe."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4340,
    "dDurationMs": 5860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It feels like your money, sitting in your\nown account, with no one else having"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 10200,
    "dDurationMs": 5420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a say. But there are three quiet rules\nthat decide how safe it really is once"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 15620,
    "dDurationMs": 4240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it lands. One of them lets the government\ntake a slice for an old debt."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 20060,
    "dDurationMs": 5700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One of them forces your bank to protect\nyou, but only if one thing was done"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 25760,
    "dDurationMs": 4260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "right. And one of them is a scam that can\nempty the account before you even"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 30020,
    "dDurationMs": 5740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "notice. Let me take them one at a time, in\nplain language, so that no one ever"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 35760,
    "dDurationMs": 4540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "catches you off guard. None of these three\nis meant to scare you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 40480,
    "dDurationMs": 5540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Each one comes with a simple way to\nprotect yourself, and by the end you will"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 46020,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "have all three in your pocket."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 48040,
    "dDurationMs": 5640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So stay with me, because the last one can\nhappen the fastest, and it is also"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 53680,
    "dDurationMs": 4380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the easiest of all to stop. Let me start\nwith the first rule, the one that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 58060,
    "dDurationMs": 2180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "surprises people the most, because they"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 60240,
    "dDurationMs": 1960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "always believed this money was\nuntouchable."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 62420,
    "dDurationMs": 3880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you owe an old debt to a government\nagency, and I do not mean your yearly"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 66300,
    "dDurationMs": 4620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "taxes, I mean something like a student\nloan from decades ago, or a benefit"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 70920,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that was once overpaid to you, the\ngovernment is allowed to reach in and take"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 73960,
    "dDurationMs": 2380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a portion of your monthly Social Security\nto pay it back."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 76540,
    "dDurationMs": 4360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They do it quietly, through a system built\nfor exactly this purpose."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 80900,
    "dDurationMs": 5100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Your payment simply comes in smaller one\nmonth, and many people do not even"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 86000,
    "dDurationMs": 4260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "understand why. Think of a man in his\nseventies who took out a small student"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 90260,
    "dDurationMs": 4820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "loan forty years ago, back when his own\nchildren were still small, and always"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 95080,
    "dDurationMs": 2020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "assumed it had faded away with time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 97380,
    "dDurationMs": 5040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It had not. One month his benefit arrives\nlighter than usual, and after days"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 102420,
    "dDurationMs": 2780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of worry and phone calls he finally learns\nthe truth."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 105200,
    "dDurationMs": 5320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That old loan was never truly closed, and\nnow a piece of every payment is being"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 110520,
    "dDurationMs": 3980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "taken to settle it. Nobody ever gave him a\nclear warning he could understand."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 114860,
    "dDurationMs": 4240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is the part that is wrong, and that\nis exactly why I am telling you now,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 119240,
    "dDurationMs": 1960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so it is never a mystery to you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 121320,
    "dDurationMs": 5040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But here is the part the government must\nfollow, and the part you need to hold"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 126360,
    "dDurationMs": 4280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "onto. The law says they cannot leave you\nwith nothing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 130640,
    "dDurationMs": 5460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They must leave you at least the first\nseven hundred fifty dollars of your"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 136100,
    "dDurationMs": 5820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "monthly benefit, every single month, no\nmatter what that old debt is, and they"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 141920,
    "dDurationMs": 2840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "can never take more than a small share of\nthe rest."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 144960,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So if your whole benefit is under seven\nhundred fifty dollars, they cannot"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 149280,
    "dDurationMs": 5020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "touch a penny of it. Above that line, they\ncan only take a slice, not the whole"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 154300,
    "dDurationMs": 5680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "thing. Now here is the quiet cruelty of\nit, and the reason this matters a little"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 159980,
    "dDurationMs": 5660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "more every year. That seven hundred fifty\ndollar floor was set back in the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 165640,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "nineteen nineties, and it has never once\nbeen raised."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 170260,
    "dDurationMs": 4980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Not for inflation, not for the rising cost\nof everything you buy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 175240,
    "dDurationMs": 5180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "While your rent and your groceries and\nyour medicine have all climbed for almost"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 180420,
    "dDurationMs": 5080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "thirty years, that protected amount has\nstood frozen in place."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 185700,
    "dDurationMs": 5960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Which means the shield the law hands you\ncovers a little less of your money"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 191660,
    "dDurationMs": 5340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with each year that goes by. So if you\never get a letter saying an old government"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 197000,
    "dDurationMs": 5220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "debt will be collected from your benefit,\ndo not panic, and do not throw it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 202220,
    "dDurationMs": 2780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in a drawer. You have the right to ask for\na review."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 205160,
    "dDurationMs": 4960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You have the right to prove hardship if\npaying would leave you unable to live."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 210280,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And you have the right to set up a\nsmaller, gentler arrangement instead."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 214920,
    "dDurationMs": 2480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The worst thing you can do is nothing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 217560,
    "dDurationMs": 2320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That letter is not the end of the story."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 219880,
    "dDurationMs": 4120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is the beginning of a conversation you\nare fully allowed to have."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 224220,
    "dDurationMs": 4620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The second rule is the one I most want you\nto remember, because it is the rare"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 228840,
    "dDurationMs": 4100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "one that works in your favor, and almost\nno one knows it is even there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 233140,
    "dDurationMs": 2380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This time the taker is not the government."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 235760,
    "dDurationMs": 2120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is a private debt collector."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 238200,
    "dDurationMs": 5500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Say an old credit card, or a medical bill,\nor some debt from years back ends"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 243700,
    "dDurationMs": 4360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "up in the hands of a collector, and they\nwin the right to freeze money in your"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 248060,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "bank account. You would think your Social\nSecurity sitting in that account"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 251660,
    "dDurationMs": 2080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is fair game for them. It is not."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 253900,
    "dDurationMs": 6240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There is a federal rule that forces your\nbank to step in and protect you, all"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 260140,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on its own, before you even ask."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 263040,
    "dDurationMs": 5920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When a collector comes after your account,\nyour bank is required to look back"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 268960,
    "dDurationMs": 5880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "over the last two months, add up every\ndollar of Social Security that was sent"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 274840,
    "dDurationMs": 5080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to you in that time, and set that whole\namount aside as untouchable."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 280040,
    "dDurationMs": 5220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The collector cannot freeze it, and you\nkeep full and normal use of it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 285340,
    "dDurationMs": 5840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Two whole months of your benefit, shielded\nautomatically, simply because the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 291180,
    "dDurationMs": 4920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "law says so. Picture a woman who fell\nbehind on a hospital bill during one"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 296100,
    "dDurationMs": 4820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "very hard year, and a collector eventually\nwon an order against her account."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 301220,
    "dDurationMs": 4540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "She was terrified they would empty it and\nleave her with nothing for the rent."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 305960,
    "dDurationMs": 5800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But because her Social Security came in by\ndirect deposit, her bank had already"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 311760,
    "dDurationMs": 5920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "set two months of it safely aside,\nuntouched, before she ever walked through"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 317680,
    "dDurationMs": 2360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the door. The collector could not reach\nit."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 320040,
    "dDurationMs": 2480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "She kept the money she needed to live on."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 322600,
    "dDurationMs": 5120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And she never even knew that shield\nexisted until the day it quietly saved"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 327720,
    "dDurationMs": 5400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "her. But here is the one thing that\ndecides whether you get that shield or"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 333120,
    "dDurationMs": 5900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "not, and it is the whole reason we are\ntalking about direct deposit today."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 339120,
    "dDurationMs": 6500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That protection only switches on if your\nbenefit arrived electronically,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 346200,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "sent straight into your account."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 348180,
    "dDurationMs": 5520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you are someone who still gets a paper\ncheck, and you carry it to the bank"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 353700,
    "dDurationMs": 6200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and deposit it by hand, the bank has no\nsimple way to see that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 359900,
    "dDurationMs": 5560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the money is Social Security, and that\nautomatic shield never turns on."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 365640,
    "dDurationMs": 6120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The very same dollars lose their\nprotection, only because of how they"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 371760,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "arrived. So the plain lesson is this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 375120,
    "dDurationMs": 5540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Having your benefit come by direct deposit\nis not just easier."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 380920,
    "dDurationMs": 6320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It quietly wraps your money in a legal\nprotection that a paper check can"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 387240,
    "dDurationMs": 5680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "never give you. The third rule is really a\nwarning, because the fastest way"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 392920,
    "dDurationMs": 5340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to lose your Social Security is not the\ngovernment, and not a collector."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 398480,
    "dDurationMs": 5060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is a thief. And the way they do it now\nis chillingly simple."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 403780,
    "dDurationMs": 5300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Somewhere out there, pieces of your\npersonal information are floating around,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 409080,
    "dDurationMs": 3880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from old data leaks you never even heard\nabout."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 412960,
    "dDurationMs": 5480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A thief gathers enough of it, contacts the\noffice that sends out your benefit,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 418660,
    "dDurationMs": 6320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "pretends to be you, and quietly changes\none single thing, the account"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 424980,
    "dDurationMs": 5960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "your money is set to land in. The next\npayment, the one you were counting on,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 431100,
    "dDurationMs": 3820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "sails right past you and into their hands."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 435160,
    "dDurationMs": 5060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the first time many people learn of it\nis when the money simply does not"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 440220,
    "dDurationMs": 4740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "arrive. Now do not let that frighten you,\nbecause the fix is every bit as simple"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 444960,
    "dDurationMs": 3820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as the crime, and it is completely in your\nown hands."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 449100,
    "dDurationMs": 5060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can set up your own protected account\nwith Social Security online, and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 454160,
    "dDurationMs": 5280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "once you have claimed it as yours, no\nstranger can walk in and pretend to be"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 459440,
    "dDurationMs": 3520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you, because the door is already locked\nfrom the inside."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 463040,
    "dDurationMs": 4820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can also ask that no change to where\nyour payment goes can ever be made"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 467860,
    "dDurationMs": 3520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "without an extra step that only you are\nable to complete."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 471380,
    "dDurationMs": 5340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And every month, in those first few days\nwhen your benefit is due, simply glance"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 476720,
    "dDurationMs": 3880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and make sure it landed. A thief is\ncounting on you not to look."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 480960,
    "dDurationMs": 4580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The very moment you become the kind of\nperson who checks, you turn into a hard"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 485540,
    "dDurationMs": 2780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "target, and they move along to an easier\none."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 488540,
    "dDurationMs": 4920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Before you go, hold on to the one thread\nthat ties all three of these together."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 493740,
    "dDurationMs": 5080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Money that arrives by direct deposit is\nprotected in ways that cash and paper"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 498820,
    "dDurationMs": 5700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "checks simply are not. The plain act of\nhaving your benefit sent straight into"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 504520,
    "dDurationMs": 4900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "your account is itself one of the\nstrongest shields you have."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 509620,
    "dDurationMs": 3035,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So make sure that is how yours arrives."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 512695,
    "dDurationMs": 2625,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Keep an eye on it in the first days of\neach month."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 515320,
    "dDurationMs": 3960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And never share the private details that\nwould let someone move it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 519420,
    "dDurationMs": 3460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you know an older person who still gets\na paper check, or who has never"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 522880,
    "dDurationMs": 3880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "heard a word of any of this, share it with\nthem, because this is the kind of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 526760,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "quiet knowledge that protects a person\nlong before they ever need it."
    } ]
  } ]
}
